# Short, shareable aliases.
#
# The asset name carries no version, so `latest/download/` genuinely does follow
# the newest release and these rules survive a version bump untouched. That is
# the whole reason for the version-free name: an earlier form of this file
# pointed at `teamree-0.1.0.dmg`, and because `latest` resolves the RELEASE and
# not the asset name, it would have 404'd the day v0.2.0 shipped -- while the
# page's own button kept working, which is the worse failure, because nobody
# thinks to test the alias.
#
# Keep this in step with the download button in index.html. If the asset is ever
# renamed again, this line and the button are the two places to change.
/download/mac  https://github.com/zero-abd/teamree/releases/latest/download/teamree-mac-universal.dmg  302
/download      https://github.com/zero-abd/teamree/releases/latest  302
